  "description": "Vali-Mediator is a lightweight .NET library for implementing the Mediator pattern with CQRS support. It simplifies request handling, pipeline behaviors, and event notifications through a fluent and extensible API. Now, using the Saga pattern, it introduces compensation flows to automatically handle remediation for failed operations, ensuring data consistency in distributed systems. Designed for seamless integration with dependency injection, it enables developers to manage commands, queries, notifications, and compensatory actions efficiently.",
  "iconFile": "Vali_Mediator_logo.png",
