  "published": "2025-04-29T21:47:53.643Z",
  "releaseNotes": "- Notification Handler Priority: Added the Priority property to INotificationHandler, allowing handlers to be executed in a user-defined order (higher priority values execute first). This is useful for scenarios where certain actions (e.g., sending emails) must precede others (e.g., updating inventory).\n            - Pre-Processors and Post-Processors: Introduced support for pre-processors and post-processors for IRequest, INotification, and IFireAndForget. Pre-processors run before handlers to perform validations or logging, while post-processors run after to process results or trigger secondary actions..",
